    "marquee": "Handcrafted Since 1996 \u00A0\u2022\u00A0 Sunwave Acoustic Technology \u00A0\u2022\u00A0 Made in Taiwan \u00A0\u2022\u00A0 Premium Tonewoods \u00A0\u2022\u00A0 ",
    "seriesLabel": "Guitar Series",
    "seriesTitle": "Series Overview",
    "viewSeries": "View Series",
    "waveDesc": "The WAVE Series features Ayers' exclusive Sunwave acoustic technology, combining selected spruce tops with rosewood back and sides to deliver warm, full-bodied sound with powerful projection. Perfect for everything from performance to recording.",
    "lightDesc": "The LIGHT Series is designed for players seeking a lighter feel and brighter tone. With a special lightweight bracing structure, the guitar maintains structural stability while offering more responsive top vibration and crystal-clear highs.",
    "sunDesc": "The SUN Series is Ayers' flagship classic, crafted with premium tonewoods and exceptional artistry. Each guitar delivers deep, powerful lows, sweet mids, and sparkling highs — the top choice for professional players.",
    "masterDesc": "The MASTER Series represents the pinnacle of Ayers artistry. Each guitar is a unique, collector-grade masterpiece featuring premium tonewoods and exquisite hand-crafted inlays — a perfect fusion of acoustic engineering and visual art.",
    "vintageDesc": "The Vintage Series carries on the classic designs of Australian luthier Gerard Gilet, delivering solid American tone and rare vintage character that revives the acoustic charm of the golden era.",
    "ukuleleDesc": "The Uluru Ukulele Series continues Ayers' commitment to tonal quality, using selected tonewoods and handcrafted construction to deliver a playing experience that exceeds expectations.",
